---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="section foot">
  <div class="wrap">
    <hr class="rule" />
    <div class="grid">
      <div>
        <p class="num eyebrow">Sources</p>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://margaretriver.rapidascent.com.au/event-details/the-race/course-description-and-maps/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Official course description</a></li>
          <li>Garmin Connect GPX exports (2024, 2025, 2026)</li>
          <li><a href="https://www.strava.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Strava</a> bulk export · <a href="https://www.trainingpeaks.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">TrainingPeaks</a> workout summary</li>
          <li>Map tiles: <a href="https://openfreemap.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">OpenFreeMap</a> · OSM contributors</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="num eyebrow">Trained by</p>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://fctc.fun" target="_blank" rel="noopener">fctc.fun</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://ogging.co" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ogging.co</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="num eyebrow">Built</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Astro, React, MapLibre GL, Observable Plot</li>
          <li><a href="https://soloterm.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">SoloTerm</a></li>
          <li>Type: Fraunces, Geist, Geist Mono</li>
          <li>Source: <a href="https://github.com/cpdis" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github.com/cpdis</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="muted small">© {year} Colin Dismuke · i just can't.</p>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .foot { padding: 4rem 0 5rem; }
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(16rem, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem 3rem;
    margin: 1rem 0 3rem;
  }
  ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  ul a { text-decoration: underline; }
  .small { font-size: 0.78rem; }
</style>
